89 \u003Ca href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">38\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> López Jimeno 1991 85-100, no. 12 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001858\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001858\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Curbera 1999 179, no. 29 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bettarini 2005 23 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">  Line 1    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[257,260,263,266,268,271,274],{"id":258,"html":259},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/SEW88NC7\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/SEW88NC7\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span> [Ἀ]πελον τὸν Λυκίνο̄ κα{κα}ταγράφο̄ πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[θ]εὸν τὰν ψυχὰν αὐτο͂ καὶ τὰν δύνασιν καὶ Λυκῖνον \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>τὸν ͱάλο̄ ͱυιὸν καὶ τὸν ἀδελφεὸν αὐτο͂· καὶ αὐτὸν \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεὸν τὸν Ναύερο&lt;ν&gt; τὸν ͱάλο̄ ͱυιὸν \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>καὶ Βοτυλον τὸν Ταμίραντος καὶ τὸ̄ς ͱυιὸ̄ς καὶ Σαριν \u003Cbr id=\"al6-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">6\u003C/span>καὶ Ἀπελον καὶ Ῥο͂μιν τὸν Καιλίο̄{ν} πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰ&lt;ν&gt; θε-\u003Cbr id=\"al7-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">7\u003C/span>ὸν καὶ τὸ̄ς ͱυιὸ̄ς καὶ Σαριν τὸν Πυρίνο̄ καὶ Πύρον \u003Cbr id=\"al8-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">8\u003C/span>τὸν Πύρο̄{ν} πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεόν· καὶ τὸ̄ς Ῥοτύ-\u003Cbr id=\"al9-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">9\u003C/span>λο̄ ͱυιὸ̄ς το͂ Πύρο̄ πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεὸν καὶ \u003Cbr id=\"al10-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">10\u003C/span>δύνασιν καὶ γλό̄σας· Πλακίταν τὸν Ναννελαίο̄ \u003Cbr id=\"al11-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">11\u003C/span>καὶ ͱάλον τὸν Πυκελεί&lt;ο̄&gt; ἐγὸ̄ τὰν ψυχὰν καταγρά-\u003Cbr id=\"al12-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">12\u003C/span>φο̄ πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεὸν καὶ δύνασιν αὐτο͂[ν]· \u003Cbr id=\"al13-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">13\u003C/span>Καδοσιν τὸν Ματυλαίο̄ καὶ Ἐκοτιν τὸν Μάγο̄ν̣&lt;ος&gt; \u003Cbr id=\"al14-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">14\u003C/span>ἐ̣νκαταγρά{ο}φο̄ πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεὸν τὰ&lt;ν&gt; ψυχὰν \u003Cbr id=\"al15-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">15\u003C/span>αὐτο͂ν· τὸν Φο&lt;ί&gt;νικος ͱυιὸν το͂ Καιλίο̄ καταγράφο̄ \u003Cbr id=\"al16-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">16\u003C/span>πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεόν. Ἀπελος Λυκίνο̄, Λυκῖνος Πύρο̄, \u003Cbr id=\"al17-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">17\u003C/span>Νανελαιος, Ἐϙοτις Μάγο̄νος, ͱαλος Πυκελείο̄{ν}, Ῥο͂μις Καιλ-\u003Cbr id=\"al18-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">18\u003C/span>ίο̄{ν}, Ἀπελος ͱο Φοίνιϙος, Τιτελος Φοίνιϙος, Ἀτος Ναυεριάδα, \u003Cbr id=\"al19-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">19\u003C/span>Τιτελος Νανελαίο̄{ν}, Σαρις Ῥόμιος. \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/SEW88NC7\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/SEW88NC7\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span> [.]ΠΕΛΟΝΤΟΝΛΥΚΙΝΟ̄ΚΑΚΑΤΑΓΡΑΦΟ̄ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[.]ΕΟΝΤΑΝΨΥΧΑΝΑΥΤΟΚΑΙΤΑΝΔΥΝΑΣΙΝΚΑΙΛΥΚΙΝΟΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΤΟΝͰΑΛΟ̄ͰΥΙΟΝΚΑΙΤΟΝΑΔΕΛΦΕΟΝΑΥΤΟΚΑΙΑΥΤΟΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΤΟΝΝΑΥΕΡΟΤΟΝͰΑΛΟ̄ͰΥΙΟΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al5-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>ΚΑΙΒΟΤΥΛΟΝΤΟΝΤΑΜΙΡΑΝΤΟΣΚΑΙΤΟ̄ΣͰΥΙΟ̄ΣΚΑΙΣΑΡΙΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al6-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">6\u003C/span>ΚΑΙΑΠΕΛΟΝΚΑΙΡΟΜΙΝΤΟΝΚΑΙΛΙΟ̄ΝΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΘΕ\u003Cbr id=\"al7-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">7\u003C/span>ΟΝΚΑΙΤΟ̄ΣͰΥΙΟ̄ΣΚΑΙΣΑΡΙΝΤΟΝΠΥΡΙΝΟ̄ΚΑΙΠΥΡΟΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al8-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">8\u003C/span>ΤΟΝΠΥΡΟ̄ΝΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΚΑΙΤΟ̄ΣΡΟΤΥ\u003Cbr id=\"al9-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">9\u003C/span>ΛΟ̄ͰΥΙΟ̄ΣΤΟΠΥΡΟ̄ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΚΑΙ\u003Cbr id=\"al10-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">10\u003C/span>ΔΥΝΑΣΙΝΚΑΙΓΛΟ̄ΣΑΣΠΛΑΚΙΤΑΝΤΟΝΝΑΝΝΕΛΑΙΟ̄\u003Cbr id=\"al11-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">11\u003C/span>ΚΑΙͰΑΛΟΝΤΟΝΠΥΚΕΛΕΙΕΓΟ̄ΤΑΝΨΥΧΑΝΚΑΤΑΓΡΑ\u003Cbr id=\"al12-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">12\u003C/span>ΦΟ̄ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΚΑΙΔΥΝΑΣΙΝΑΥΤΟ[.]\u003Cbr id=\"al13-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">13\u003C/span>ΚΑΔΟΣΙΝΤΟΝΜΑΤΥΛΑΙΟ̄ΚΑΙΕΚΟΤΙΝΤΟΝΜΑΓΟ̄.\u003Cbr id=\"al14-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">14\u003C/span>.ΝΚΑΤΑΓΡΑΟΦΟ̄ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΤΑΨΥΧΑΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al15-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">15\u003C/span>ΑΥΤΟΝΤΟΝΦΟΝΙΚΟΣͰΥΙΟΝΤΟΚΑΙΛΙΟ̄ΚΑΤΑΓΡΑΦΟ̄\u003Cbr id=\"al16-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">16\u003C/span>ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΑΠΕΛΟΣΛΥΚΙΝΟ̄ΛΥΚΙΝΟΣΠΥΡΟ̄\u003Cbr id=\"al17-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">17\u003C/span>ΝΑΝΕΛΑΙΟΣΕϘΟΤΙΣΜΑΓΟ̄ΝΟΣͰΑΛΟΣΠΥΚΕΛΕΙΟ̄ΝΡΟΜΙΣΚΑΙΛ\u003Cbr id=\"al18-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">18\u003C/span>ΙΟ̄ΝΑΠΕΛΟΣͰΟΦΟΙΝΙϘΟΣΤΙΤΕΛΟΣΦΟΙΝΙϘΟΣΑΤΟΣΝΑΥΕΡΙΑΔΑ\u003Cbr id=\"al19-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">19\u003C/span>ΤΙΤΕΛΟΣΝΑΝΕΛΑΙΟ̄ΝΣΑΡΙΣΡΟΜΙΟΣ\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":261,"html":262},"apparatus","\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text after Bettarini no.23\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>  \u003C/span>; \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>  \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":264,"html":265},"translation","\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":264,"html":267},"\u003Ch2>Italian translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":269,"html":270},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":272,"html":273},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1959 16.0573 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Jordan 1985 176, no.107 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001391\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001391\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Arena 1989 63 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000638\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000638\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Dubois 1989 \u003Ca href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">38\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> López Jimeno 1991 85-100, no. 12 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001858\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001858\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Curbera 1999 179, no. 29 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002060\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bettarini 2005 23 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":275,"html":276},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[278,280,283,284],{"html":279},"Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/SEW88NC7\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/SEW88NC7\u003C/a>",{"id":281,"lang":121,"html":282},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span> [Ἀ]πελον τὸν Λυκίνο̄ κα{κα}ταγράφο̄ πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[θ]εὸν τὰν ψυχὰν αὐτο͂ καὶ τὰν δύνασιν καὶ Λυκῖνον \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>τὸν ͱάλο̄ ͱυιὸν καὶ τὸν ἀδελφεὸν αὐτο͂· καὶ αὐτὸν \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεὸν τὸν Ναύερο&lt;ν&gt; τὸν ͱάλο̄ ͱυιὸν \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>καὶ Βοτυλον τὸν Ταμίραντος καὶ τὸ̄ς ͱυιὸ̄ς καὶ Σαριν \u003Cbr id=\"al6-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">6\u003C/span>καὶ Ἀπελον καὶ Ῥο͂μιν τὸν Καιλίο̄{ν} πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰ&lt;ν&gt; θε-\u003Cbr id=\"al7-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">7\u003C/span>ὸν καὶ τὸ̄ς ͱυιὸ̄ς καὶ Σαριν τὸν Πυρίνο̄ καὶ Πύρον \u003Cbr id=\"al8-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">8\u003C/span>τὸν Πύρο̄{ν} πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεόν· καὶ τὸ̄ς Ῥοτύ-\u003Cbr id=\"al9-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">9\u003C/span>λο̄ ͱυιὸ̄ς το͂ Πύρο̄ πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεὸν καὶ \u003Cbr id=\"al10-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">10\u003C/span>δύνασιν καὶ γλό̄σας· Πλακίταν τὸν Ναννελαίο̄ \u003Cbr id=\"al11-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">11\u003C/span>καὶ ͱάλον τὸν Πυκελεί&lt;ο̄&gt; ἐγὸ̄ τὰν ψυχὰν καταγρά-\u003Cbr id=\"al12-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">12\u003C/span>φο̄ πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεὸν καὶ δύνασιν αὐτο͂[ν]· \u003Cbr id=\"al13-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">13\u003C/span>Καδοσιν τὸν Ματυλαίο̄ καὶ Ἐκοτιν τὸν Μάγο̄ν̣&lt;ος&gt; \u003Cbr id=\"al14-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">14\u003C/span>ἐ̣νκαταγρά{ο}φο̄ πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεὸν τὰ&lt;ν&gt; ψυχὰν \u003Cbr id=\"al15-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">15\u003C/span>αὐτο͂ν· τὸν Φο&lt;ί&gt;νικος ͱυιὸν το͂ Καιλίο̄ καταγράφο̄ \u003Cbr id=\"al16-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">16\u003C/span>πὰρ τὰν ͱαγνὰν θεόν. Ἀπελος Λυκίνο̄, Λυκῖνος Πύρο̄, \u003Cbr id=\"al17-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">17\u003C/span>Νανελαιος, Ἐϙοτις Μάγο̄νος, ͱαλος Πυκελείο̄{ν}, Ῥο͂μις Καιλ-\u003Cbr id=\"al18-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">18\u003C/span>ίο̄{ν}, Ἀπελος ͱο Φοίνιϙος, Τιτελος Φοίνιϙος, Ἀτος Ναυεριάδα, \u003Cbr id=\"al19-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">19\u003C/span>Τιτελος Νανελαίο̄{ν}, Σαρις Ῥόμιος. \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>",{"html":279},{"id":285,"lang":121,"html":286},"edition-diplomatic","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span> [.]ΠΕΛΟΝΤΟΝΛΥΚΙΝΟ̄ΚΑΚΑΤΑΓΡΑΦΟ̄ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[.]ΕΟΝΤΑΝΨΥΧΑΝΑΥΤΟΚΑΙΤΑΝΔΥΝΑΣΙΝΚΑΙΛΥΚΙΝΟΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΤΟΝͰΑΛΟ̄ͰΥΙΟΝΚΑΙΤΟΝΑΔΕΛΦΕΟΝΑΥΤΟΚΑΙΑΥΤΟΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΤΟΝΝΑΥΕΡΟΤΟΝͰΑΛΟ̄ͰΥΙΟΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al5-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>ΚΑΙΒΟΤΥΛΟΝΤΟΝΤΑΜΙΡΑΝΤΟΣΚΑΙΤΟ̄ΣͰΥΙΟ̄ΣΚΑΙΣΑΡΙΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al6-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">6\u003C/span>ΚΑΙΑΠΕΛΟΝΚΑΙΡΟΜΙΝΤΟΝΚΑΙΛΙΟ̄ΝΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΘΕ\u003Cbr id=\"al7-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">7\u003C/span>ΟΝΚΑΙΤΟ̄ΣͰΥΙΟ̄ΣΚΑΙΣΑΡΙΝΤΟΝΠΥΡΙΝΟ̄ΚΑΙΠΥΡΟΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al8-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">8\u003C/span>ΤΟΝΠΥΡΟ̄ΝΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΚΑΙΤΟ̄ΣΡΟΤΥ\u003Cbr id=\"al9-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">9\u003C/span>ΛΟ̄ͰΥΙΟ̄ΣΤΟΠΥΡΟ̄ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΚΑΙ\u003Cbr id=\"al10-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">10\u003C/span>ΔΥΝΑΣΙΝΚΑΙΓΛΟ̄ΣΑΣΠΛΑΚΙΤΑΝΤΟΝΝΑΝΝΕΛΑΙΟ̄\u003Cbr id=\"al11-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">11\u003C/span>ΚΑΙͰΑΛΟΝΤΟΝΠΥΚΕΛΕΙΕΓΟ̄ΤΑΝΨΥΧΑΝΚΑΤΑΓΡΑ\u003Cbr id=\"al12-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">12\u003C/span>ΦΟ̄ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΚΑΙΔΥΝΑΣΙΝΑΥΤΟ[.]\u003Cbr id=\"al13-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">13\u003C/span>ΚΑΔΟΣΙΝΤΟΝΜΑΤΥΛΑΙΟ̄ΚΑΙΕΚΟΤΙΝΤΟΝΜΑΓΟ̄.\u003Cbr id=\"al14-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">14\u003C/span>.ΝΚΑΤΑΓΡΑΟΦΟ̄ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΤΑΨΥΧΑΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al15-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">15\u003C/span>ΑΥΤΟΝΤΟΝΦΟΝΙΚΟΣͰΥΙΟΝΤΟΚΑΙΛΙΟ̄ΚΑΤΑΓΡΑΦΟ̄\u003Cbr id=\"al16-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">16\u003C/span>ΠΑΡΤΑΝͰΑΓΝΑΝΘΕΟΝΑΠΕΛΟΣΛΥΚΙΝΟ̄ΛΥΚΙΝΟΣΠΥΡΟ̄\u003Cbr id=\"al17-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">17\u003C/span>ΝΑΝΕΛΑΙΟΣΕϘΟΤΙΣΜΑΓΟ̄ΝΟΣͰΑΛΟΣΠΥΚΕΛΕΙΟ̄